{"ID":"20240506082107-6oieuiu","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240506082107-6oieuiu","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240506082107-6oieuiu\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240626101754-a4udpss\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240612100012-5ingtek\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:2122,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240626100818-fu1qra6\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:10\u0026#125;","title":"213秦椒（秦菽）","type":"doc","updated":"20240908165350"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240626101754-a4udpss","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240626101754-a4udpss","updated":"20240702112208"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 397px;","style":"width: 387px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"蜀椒"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/蜀椒-20240702111743-we0lpz4.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 387px;\" parent-style=\"width: 397px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 619px;","style":"width: 609px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240626101820-q74fk4g.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 609px;\" parent-style=\"width: 619px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"}]},{"ID":"20240626101221-u0ey3dz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240626101221-u0ey3dz","updated":"20240626102224"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 401px;","style":"width: 391px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240626101909-18rz5tv.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 391px;\" parent-style=\"width: 401px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 421px;","style":"width: 411px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240626101221-0inri81.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 411px;\" parent-style=\"width: 421px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 384px;","style":"width: 374px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"花椒9"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/花椒9-20240626102224-mf8ls89.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 374px;\" parent-style=\"width: 384px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​​​"}]},{"ID":"20240626100915-3b4fj6i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240626100915-3b4fj6i","updated":"20240626101032"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 611px;","style":"width: 601px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"花椒"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/花椒-20240626101032-aac0alf.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 601px;\" parent-style=\"width: 611px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 577px;","style":"width: 567px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240626100941-2ymn3zi.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 567px;\" parent-style=\"width: 577px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240908165255-v3fc37a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240908165255-v3fc37a","updated":"20240908165255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 652px;","style":"width: 642px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240702111923-63unsea.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 642px;\" parent-style=\"width: 652px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 609px;","style":"width: 599px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240619184926-oodnkfi.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 599px;\" parent-style=\"width: 609px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240626101627-mbcxb6w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240626101627-mbcxb6w","updated":"20240626102041"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 612px;","style":"width: 602px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"花椒3"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/花椒3-20240626101627-20icx1h.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 602px;\" parent-style=\"width: 612px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 645px;","style":"width: 635px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"花椒7"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/花椒7-20240626102041-q3l9dkb.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 635px;\" parent-style=\"width: 645px;\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240626101928-5oxfnbe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240626101928-5oxfnbe","updated":"20240908165309"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 538px;","style":"width: 528px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"花椒10"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/花椒10-20240626102639-g0fi1nq.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 528px;\" parent-style=\"width: 538px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 712px;","style":"width: 702px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240626102811-07yioca.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 702px;\" parent-style=\"width: 712px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240626100818-fu1qra6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240626100818-fu1qra6","updated":"20240908165350"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"注：这里秦椒与蜀椒取图一致，取花椒；（有说法称：秦椒出天水，蜀椒出武都）"}]},{"ID":"20240612095955-jg7uy0m","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612095955-jg7uy0m"}},{"ID":"20240626100126-iwsx6up","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240626100126-iwsx6up","updated":"20240626100131"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"秦菽《神农本草经》"}]},{"ID":"20240626100126-4t4iztl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240626100126-4t4iztl","updated":"20240626100126"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味辛温。"}]},{"ID":"20240626100126-n3eanmb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240626100126-n3eanmb","updated":"20240626100126"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主风邪气，温中除寒痹，坚齿发，明目。久服，轻身，好颜色，耐老增年，通神。生川谷。"}]},{"ID":"20240626100126-0q8v0rb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240626100126-0q8v0rb","updated":"20240626100126"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《名医》曰：生太山及秦岭上，或琅邪，八月九月采实。"}]},{"ID":"20240626100126-oel1zmc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240626100126-oel1zmc","updated":"20240626100126"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"案《说文》云：菽，菽萯.莍菽榝实莍裹如裘者，榝似茱萸，出淮南。《广雅》云：榝（木卡），茱萸也。北山经云：景山多秦椒。郭璞云，子似椒面细叶草也。"}]},{"ID":"20240626100126-63h58ow","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240626100126-63h58ow","updated":"20240626100126"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《尔雅》云：（木毁），大椒。郭璞云：今椒树丛生实大者，名为（木毁），又椒丑莍.郭璞云：（上亠下裘）萸子聚成房貌，今江东亦呼莍榝，似茱萸而小，赤色。《毛诗》云：椒聊之实。《传》云：椒卿，椒也。陆玑云：椒树似茱萸，有针刺，叶坚而滑泽，蜀人作茶，吴人作茗，皆合煮其叶以为香。《范子计然》云：秦椒出天水陇西，细者善。《淮南子》人间训云：申椒杜茞，美人之所怀服，旧作椒，非，据《山海经》，有秦椒，生闻喜景山，则秦非秦地之秦也。"}]},{"ID":"20240612095955-ctrva7a","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612095955-ctrva7a"}},{"ID":"20240612100016-w0sfnre","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612100016-w0sfnre","updated":"20240612100021"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"秦椒《本草纲目》"}]},{"ID":"20240612100016-pupj2n9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612100016-pupj2n9","updated":"20240612100016"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「释名」大椒、椒（按椒红即椒的果壳）。"}]},{"ID":"20240612100016-b0o1dte","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612100016-b0o1dte","updated":"20240612100016"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「气味」（椒红）辛、温、有毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240612100016-mpmhb9b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612100016-mpmhb9b","updated":"20240612100016"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「主治」"}]},{"ID":"20240612100016-bo86ykc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612100016-bo86ykc","updated":"20240612100016"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1、饮少尿多。用秦椒、瓜蒂各二分，研为末，每服一匙，水送下。一天服三次。"}]},{"ID":"20240612100016-fe7thm5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612100016-fe7thm5","updated":"20240612100016"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2、手足心肿。用椒和盐末等分，醋调匀敷肿处。"}]},{"ID":"20240612100016-93okb6u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612100016-93okb6u","updated":"20240612100016"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3、久患口疮。用秦椒去掉闭口的颗粒然后水海洗面拌煮为粥，空心腹，以饭压下。重者可多服几次，以愈为度。"}]},{"ID":"20240612100016-bbv2129","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612100016-bbv2129","updated":"20240612100016"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4、牙齿风痛。用秦椒煎醋含漱。"}]},{"ID":"20240612100213-zr5ne7i","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612100213-zr5ne7i"}},{"ID":"20240612100215-fo36akl","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612100215-fo36akl","updated":"20240612100219"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"秦椒《本草衍义》"}]},{"ID":"20240612100215-4dwbwe1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612100215-4dwbwe1","updated":"20240612100215"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"此秦地所生者，故言秦椒。大率椒株皆相似，秦椒但叶差大，椒粒亦大而纹低，不若蜀椒皱纹高，为异也。然秦地亦有蜀种椒，如此区别。"}]},{"ID":"20240612100324-njnywcx","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612100324-njnywcx"}},{"ID":"20240612100325-23s3doe","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612100325-23s3doe","updated":"20240612100335"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"秦椒《本经逢原》"}]},{"ID":"20240612100325-ljrik81","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612100325-ljrik81","updated":"20240612100325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"辛，温，有毒。去目炒去汗，取红用。其叶九瓣者，秦椒也。闭口者有毒，误食之戟人咽喉，气欲绝，或吐下白沫，身体痹冷，肉桂煎汁饮之，多饮冷水一二升，或食蒜，或饮地浆，或浓煎豆豉饮之，并解。"}]},{"ID":"20240612100325-hixhves","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612100325-hixhves","updated":"20240612100325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《本经》除风邪气，温中去寒痹，坚齿发，明目。"}]},{"ID":"20240612100325-au84k23","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612100325-au84k23","updated":"20240612100325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"〔发明〕秦椒味辛气烈，过于蜀椒，其温中去痹、除风邪气、治吐逆疝瘕、下肿湿气，皆取辛烈以散郁热，乃从治之法也，不宜多服。令须发易白，以其气辛，非蜀椒之比。臭毒疮毒腹痛，冷水下一握效，其能通三焦、引正气、下恶气可知也。"}]},{"ID":"20240612100308-20qrlzz","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612100308-20qrlzz"}},{"ID":"20240612100309-wvxtvkz","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612100309-wvxtvkz","updated":"20240612100319"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"秦椒《名医别录》"}]},{"ID":"20240612100309-nahdsfs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612100309-nahdsfs","updated":"20240612100309"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生温，熟寒，有毒。主治喉痹，吐逆，疝瘕，去老血，产后余疾，腹痛，出汗，利五脏。生太山及秦岭上，或瑯瑘。八月、九月采实。（恶栝蒌、防葵，畏雌黄。）"}]},{"ID":"20240612100309-nh2v5l5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612100309-nh2v5l5","updated":"20240612100309"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《本经》原文：秦椒，味辛，温。主风邪气，温中，除寒痹，坚齿发，明目。久服，轻身好颜色，耐老增年通神。生川谷。"}]},{"ID":"20240612100253-0eu903k","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612100253-0eu903k"}},{"ID":"20240612100254-rzavu4w","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612100254-rzavu4w","updated":"20240612100301"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"秦椒《本草经集注》"}]},{"ID":"20240612100254-qa8bp0e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612100254-qa8bp0e","updated":"20240612100254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味辛，温、生温熟寒，有毒。主治风邪气，温中，除寒痹，坚齿长发，明目。治喉痹，吐逆，疝瘕，去老血，产后余疾，腹痛，出汗，利五脏。久服轻身，好颜色，耐老，增年，通神。生太山川谷及秦岭上，或琅琊。八月、九月采实。（恶栝蒌、防葵，畏雌黄。）"}]},{"ID":"20240612100254-0rvvc0w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612100254-0rvvc0w","updated":"20240612100254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"今从西来，形似椒而大，色黄黑，味亦颇有椒气，或呼为大椒。又云：即今樛树子，而樛子是楮椒，恐谬。"}]},{"ID":"20240612100238-vo4zru1","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612100238-vo4zru1"}},{"ID":"20240612100239-td6evn7","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612100239-td6evn7","updated":"20240612100245"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"秦椒《本草图经》"}]},{"ID":"20240612100239-zmddq6n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612100239-zmddq6n","updated":"20240612100242"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"秦椒"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，生泰山川谷及秦岭上，或琅琊，今秦、凤间及明、越、金、商州皆有之。初秋生花，秋末结实，九月、十月采。陶隐居云∶似椒而大，色黄黑，或呼大椒。苏恭云∶叶及茎、子都似蜀椒，但实细味短。《尔雅》云∶ ，大椒。郭璞云∶椒丛生，生实大者名为 。《诗·唐风》云∶椒聊。且陆机疏云∶椒似茱萸，有针刺。茎、叶坚而滑，蜀人作茶，吴人作茗，皆合煮其叶以为香。今成皋诸山谓之竹叶椒，其木亦如蜀椒，少毒热，不中合药，可着饮食中，又用蒸鸡、豚最佳。东海诸岛上亦有椒，枝、叶皆相似。子长而不圆，甚香，其味似橘皮。岛上獐鹿食其叶，其肉自然作椒、橘香。而今南北所生一种椒，其实大于蜀椒，与陶及郭、陆之说正相合，当以实大者为秦椒。其云蜀、吴作茶、茗，皆煮其叶，今不复如此。"}]},{"ID":"20240612100239-sm0bnj7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612100239-sm0bnj7","updated":"20240612100239"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"盖古人所食，与今异者多矣。故苦 （与茶同）条云∶作饮加茱萸、葱、姜等良，是也。相传椒可以来水银。又云椒气好下，言饵之益下，不上冲也。服食药当用蜀椒。"}]},{"ID":"20240612100225-efho5nj","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612100225-efho5nj"}},{"ID":"20240612100227-gaubey8","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612100227-gaubey8","updated":"20240612100231"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"秦椒《本经逢原》"}]},{"ID":"20240612100227-wtte1hb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612100227-wtte1hb","updated":"20240612100227"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"辛温有毒。去目炒去汗取红用，其叶九瓣者秦椒也。闭口者有毒，误食之戟入咽喉，气欲绝。或吐下白沫，身体痹冷，肉桂煎汁饮之。多饮冷水一二升，或食蒜，或饮地浆，或浓煎豆豉饮之并解。"}]},{"ID":"20240612100227-qyuaezq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612100227-qyuaezq","updated":"20240612100227"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《本经》除风邪气，温中去寒痹，坚齿发明目。"}]},{"ID":"20240612100227-hl89ryi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612100227-hl89ryi","updated":"20240612100227"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"发明"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"秦椒味辛气烈过于蜀椒，其温中去痹除风邪气，治吐逆疝瘕，下肿湿气，皆取辛烈，以散郁热，乃从治之法也，不宜多服。令须发易白，以其气辛非蜀椒之比。臭毒疮毒腹痛，冷水下一握效。其能通三焦引正气，下恶气可知也。"}]},{"ID":"20240612100204-7i4ob34","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612100204-7i4ob34"}},{"ID":"20240612100205-73y0vj0","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612100205-73y0vj0","updated":"20240612100209"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"秦椒《本草乘雅半偈》"}]},{"ID":"20240612100205-rdvl3pf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612100205-rdvl3pf","updated":"20240612100205"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（本经中品）"}]},{"ID":"20240612100205-tq77mil","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612100205-tq77mil","updated":"20240612100205"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"含蓄者，自然酝藉；发露者，自然浅薄。"}]},{"ID":"20240612100205-qxu1gc5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612100205-qxu1gc5","updated":"20240612100205"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【气味】辛温，无毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240612100205-otxy4ts","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612100205-otxy4ts","updated":"20240612100205"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【主治】主除风邪气，温中，去寒痹，坚齿发，明目。久服轻身，好颜色，耐老，增年，通"}]},{"ID":"20240612100205-1bryu6r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612100205-1bryu6r","updated":"20240612100205"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【核】曰∶秦椒花椒也。始产于秦，今处处有之，极易繁衍。其叶对生，尖而有刺。四月生细花。五月结青实，熟则红赤，大于蜀椒，其目不及蜀椒之光且黑也。恶栝蒌、防葵，畏雄黄。"}]},{"ID":"20240612100205-ukwwh8i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612100205-ukwwh8i","updated":"20240612100205"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【 】曰∶椒分秦、蜀者，不惟方域异。大小牝牡有别也。秦地者，开花结实、实大于牡；蜀地者，无花作实，实小于牝，其色馨气味，精胜实肤，与温中通痹，主司形气则一也。"}]},{"ID":"20240612100205-15i9m29","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612100205-15i9m29","updated":"20240612100205"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"但无花者，性深邃，力从内骨。横遍肤表，主益气而归肺。有花者，性舒徐，力从中脏，横遍皮毛，明目窍，坚骨余，主通神而归心为别异耳。盖中脏通乎神，故久服轻身，好颜色，耐老增年，通神也。"}]},{"ID":"20240612100153-h2zsxp9","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612100153-h2zsxp9"}},{"ID":"20240612100155-scei1f1","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612100155-scei1f1","updated":"20240612100159"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"秦椒《本草择要纲目》"}]},{"ID":"20240612100155-bn3yurc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612100155-bn3yurc","updated":"20240612100155"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【气味】"}]},{"ID":"20240612100155-e7q6qfk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612100155-e7q6qfk","updated":"20240612100155"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"辛温有毒．"}]},{"ID":"20240612100155-36wy757","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612100155-36wy757","updated":"20240612100155"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【主治】"}]},{"ID":"20240612100155-m7qu3ac","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612100155-m7qu3ac","updated":"20240612100155"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"除风邪气．温中去寒痹．坚齿发．明目．久服轻身好颜色耐老增年通神．疗喉痹吐逆疝瘕．去老血产后余疾腹痛．出汗．利五脏．上气咳嗽．久风湿痹．治恶风遍身四肢 痹．口齿浮肿摇动．女人月闭不通．产后恶血痢．多年痢．疗腹中冷痛．生毛发灭瘢．能下肿湿气．"}]},{"ID":"20240612100155-agyu4j7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612100155-agyu4j7","updated":"20240612100155"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【恶】（苦蒌 防葵）"}]},{"ID":"20240612100155-zoaj1i7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612100155-zoaj1i7","updated":"20240612100155"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【畏】（雌黄）"}]},{"ID":"20240612100110-yks1s4r","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612100110-yks1s4r"}},{"ID":"20240612100111-2bvi0rj","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612100111-2bvi0rj","updated":"20240612100115"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"秦椒《本草从新》"}]},{"ID":"20240612100111-ouxfbra","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612100111-ouxfbra","updated":"20240612100111"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"俗名花椒．宣散寒、燥湿温中．"}]},{"ID":"20240612100111-q7kgl8s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612100111-q7kgl8s","updated":"20240612100111"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"辛苦温．有毒．温中散寒．燥湿除风．下气杀虫．治上气．咳嗽吐逆疝瘕．风湿寒痹．"}]},{"ID":"20240612100111-gzy8lay","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612100111-gzy8lay","updated":"20240612100111"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"利五脏．去老血．疗久痢．月闭．腹中冷痛．产后余疾．恶血痢．腹痛．禁忌修治．俱同川椒．"}]},{"ID":"20240612100111-x28c4ul","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612100111-x28c4ul","updated":"20240612100111"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"比川椒味短．纹低．恶苦蒌、防葵．畏雄黄．（手足心肿、风也、椒末盐等分、醋和敷．）"}]},{"ID":"20240612100128-p18mgzo","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612100128-p18mgzo"}},{"ID":"20240612100129-xat4cbl","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612100129-xat4cbl","updated":"20240612100134"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"秦椒《证类本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240612100129-1182jlr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612100129-1182jlr","updated":"20240612100129"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味辛，温，，生温熟寒，有毒。主风邪气，温中除寒痹，坚齿发，明目，疗喉痹，吐逆，疝瘕，去老血，产后余疾腹痛，出汗，利五脏。久服轻身，好颜色，耐老增年通神。生太山川谷及秦岭上，或琅邪。八月、九月采实。（恶栝蒌、防葵、畏雌黄。）"}]},{"ID":"20240612100129-jcq7nfy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612100129-jcq7nfy","updated":"20240612100129"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"陶隐居云∶今从西来。形似椒而大，色黄黑，味亦颇有椒气。或呼为大椒。又云∶即今（居虬切）树。而 子是猪椒，恐谬。唐本注云∶秦椒树，叶及茎、子都似蜀椒，但味短实细水陇西，细者善。药性论云∶秦椒，君，味苦、辛。能治恶风遍身，四肢 痹，口齿浮肿摇动，主女人月闭不通，治产后恶血痢，多年痢，主生发，疗腹中冷痛。孟诜云∶秦椒，温。"}]},{"ID":"20240612100129-5ksj122","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612100129-5ksj122","updated":"20240612100129"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"灭瘢，长毛，去血。若齿痛，醋煎含之。又损疮中风者，以面作馄饨，灰中烧之使热，断使口开，封其疮上，冷即易之。"}]},{"ID":"20240612100129-n4pdo6s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612100129-n4pdo6s","updated":"20240612100129"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"又法∶去闭口者水洗，面拌煮作粥。空腹吞之，以饭压之，重者可再服，以瘥为度。"}]},{"ID":"20240612100129-xhlsjsh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612100129-xhlsjsh","updated":"20240612100129"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"图经曰∶秦椒，生泰山川谷及秦岭上或琅邪，今秦、凤、及明、越、金、商州皆有之。"}]},{"ID":"20240612100129-c6nywej","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612100129-c6nywej","updated":"20240612100129"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"初秋生花秋末结实，九月、十月采。陶隐居云∶似椒而大，色黄黑，或呼大椒。苏恭云∶叶及茎、子都似蜀椒，但实细味短。《尔雅》云∶ ，大椒。郭璞云∶椒丛生，生实大者名为。《诗·唐风》云∶椒聊且。陆机疏云∶椒似茱萸，有针刺。茎叶坚而滑。蜀人作茶，吴人作茗，皆合煮其叶以为香。今成皋诸山谓之竹叶椒，其木亦如蜀椒，少毒热，不中合药，可着饮食中。又用蒸鸡、豚最佳。东海诸岛上亦有椒，枝、叶皆相似。子长而不圆，甚香，其味似橘皮。岛上獐、鹿食其叶，其肉自然作椒、橘香。而今南北所生一种椒，其实大于蜀椒，与陶及郭、陆之说正相合，当以实大者为秦椒。其云蜀、吴作茶、茗，皆煮其叶，今不复如此。盖古人所食，与今异者多矣。故苦KT （与茶同条）云。作饮加茱萸、葱、姜等良是也。相传椒可以来水银。又云椒气好下，言饵之益下，不上冲也。服食药当用蜀椒。"}]},{"ID":"20240612100129-m6qrh3w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612100129-m6qrh3w","updated":"20240612100143"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"肘后方∶手足心风肿。椒、盐末等分，醋和敷之，良。伤寒类要∶治膏瘅，其人饮少小便多方∶秦椒一分出汗，瓜蒂二分末。水服方寸匕，日三服。续十全方∶治虫入耳。椒末一钱，醋半衍义曰∶秦椒，此秦地所实者，故言秦椒。大率椒株皆相似，秦椒但叶差大，椒粒亦大而纹...（后续内容缺）"}]},{"ID":"20240612095955-sg15nqt","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612095955-sg15nqt"}},{"ID":"20240612095956-16fw97l","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612095956-16fw97l","updated":"20240612100002"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"秦椒《增广和剂局方药性总论》"}]},{"ID":"20240612095956-mf67vir","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612095956-mf67vir","updated":"20240612095956"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味辛，温、生温熟寒，有毒。主风邪气，温中，除寒痹，坚齿发，明目，疗喉痹，吐疝瘕，去老血，产后余疾，肿痛，出汗，利五脏。《药性论》云∶君。味苦辛。治恶风身四肢顽痹，口齿浮肿摇动，主女人月闭不通，治产后恶血痢。多年痢。腹中冷痛。恶萎、防葵。畏∶雌黄。"}]},{"ID":"20240612095957-67h50zv","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612095957-67h50zv"}},{"ID":"20240612100007-39tkqs9","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612100007-39tkqs9","updated":"20240612100011"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"秦椒《千金翼方》"}]},{"ID":"20240612100007-hdhs5vk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612100007-hdhs5vk","updated":"20240612100007"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味辛，温，生温；熟寒，有毒。主风邪气，温中，除寒痹，坚齿发，明目，疗喉吐逆疝瘕，去老血，产后余疾，腹痛出汗，利五脏。久服轻身，好颜色，耐老增年通神。生大山川谷及秦岭上，或琅邪，八月九月采实。"}]},{"ID":"20240612100011-jntkfto","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612100011-jntkfto"}},{"ID":"20240612100012-5ingtek","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612100012-5ingtek"}}]}